=\"106\"><span mathquill-command-id=\"105\">2</span></span></span><var mathquill-command-id=\"108\">x</var></span><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:0\">​</span></span></span></div></div>",
      "rendered_text": "ex(cosx−sinx)8sin2x​",
